7849947, "videos": 1, "tid": 201, "tname": "科学科普", "copyright": 3, "pic": "http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/11267b6c7099ac71f4232bc9d3cc98dc633ce69c.jpg", "title": "即将17级以上：台风白海豚强度将超巴威，为什么今年风王会这么多", "pubdate": 1785337096, "ctime": 1785337097, "desc": "在7月28日白天的猛烈爆发之后，7月28日夜间白海豚经历了一次成熟台风的结构调整，也就是我们之前经常说的“眼壁置换”。在这次眼壁置换中，白海豚的核心云团扩大了两倍以上，台风眼直径从10公里以下扩大到了30公里左右。正如我们之前节目所说，眼壁置换类似于螃蟹脱壳，是成熟台风长大并且重新分配能量的方式，如果眼壁置换成功，台风将重新加强。\n很明显，白海豚的第一次眼壁置换非常成功。7月29日晚上，它的核心对流云团高耸强烈，台风眼浑圆犀利，且在快速清空，晚上8点，它中心附近最大风力已经达到17级，60米/秒。不出意外", "state": 0, "duration": 193, "mission_id": 4065027, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "movie": 0, "pay": 0, "hd5": 0, "no_reprint": 0, "autoplay": 1, "ugc_pay": 0, "is_cooperation": 0, "ugc_pay_preview": 0, "no_background": 0, "arc_pay": 0, "pay_free_watch": 0}, "owner": {"mid": 547072854, "name": "中气爱", "face": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/face/e5f6be30a18988ed92f677e6a47a346270172081.jpg"}, "stat": {"aid": 117003817849947, "view": 487494, "danmaku": 1160, "reply": 3172, "favorite": 1487, "coin": 709, "share": 2156, "now_rank": 0, "his_rank": 0, "like": 21878, "dislike": 0, "vt": 0, "vv": 487494, "fav_g": 0, "like_g": 0}, "dynamic": "", "cid": 40416382532, "dimension": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080, "rotate": 0}, "short_link_v2": "https://b23.tv/BV13J3n6gEkC", "first_frame": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/storyff/_00001mg3e6mxtpbr12lp584yi47797b_firsti.jpg", "pub_location": "江苏", "cover43": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bd431aa9df73c1aad4169d322e8dc764aee91916.jpg", "tidv2": 2207, "tnamev2": "随拍·综合", "pid_v2": 1032, "pid_name_v2": "其他", "bvid": "BV13J3n6gEkC", "season_type": 0, "is_ogv": false, "ogv_info": null, "enable_vt": 0, "ai_rcmd": null, "rcmd_reason": {"content": "", "corner_mark": 0}}, {"aid": 116997408951130, "videos": 1, "tid": 228, "tname": "人文历史", "copyright": 1, "pic": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bab56652c79f42dc645f1587b17eab57de680510.jpg", "title": "欧盟打算同时对抗中美", "pubdate": 1785297000, "ctime": 1785239682, "desc": "本视频提及事件以及信息来源如下：\n《谷歌参